{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":97860,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793374329668,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2020,"episodeCount":13,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aNKm1aJxSyBY2Gfy8O7EYveS4VJ.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2049101","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"BALL","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"She wanted to see the stars. He wanted to be with her. What do you desire that you would give your life for? Only those with the strength to survive can acquire that which they seek at the top of the tower.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hhDXLaY8458wbL1k7oOm6sUrTZy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hhDXLaY8458wbL1k7oOm6sUrTZy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"2199909","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"3/400","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Bam overcomes Headon’s test and ascends to the second level of the tower. \"The Black March\" Bam received from Yuri catches the attention of Khun, who toys with him. Together they aim for the top, but…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3luCcef8HLyX0xSvo1dDxXxDMLA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3luCcef8HLyX0xSvo1dDxXxDMLA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"2199910","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"La porta giusta","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"When Test Director Hansung Yu announces the subject of the test, Rak throws a tantrum, and Bam calms him. Meanwhile, the gears in Khun’s head alone are turning. Second by second, time moves forward. What will they do?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ssQDfI6iXtdHKeTTHGG4j1bSgiC.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ssQDfI6iXtdHKeTTHGG4j1bSgiC.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2199911","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Aprile Verde","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"At the end of the first round of the Crown Game, Anaak, wielder of the ever-changing sword \"The Green April,\" sits upon the throne. Bam, Khun, and Rak wait for the right moment to participate. Will they survive until the end of this bonus game?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sURF143QfDcJ2FPpB7cNHgvfY4B.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sURF143QfDcJ2FPpB7cNHgvfY4B.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2199912","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Il destino della corona","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Bam’s team defends the crown from the looming Regulars. As they charge into battle one after alone, Bam is distracted by a lone girl. The Regulars attack Bam, but…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/c9pKszVjPF0Fk3o0CSyzwhjGPAq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c9pKszVjPF0Fk3o0CSyzwhjGPAq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2199913","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"La selezione della posizione","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"What will Khun do after meeting Rachel? The position selection begins, and despite struggling with their assignments, the examinees grow closer. Meanwhile, someone watches them and ruminates from afar…","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xgan2UAwoiuA7nwS7UjBZVuDQOy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xgan2UAwoiuA7nwS7UjBZVuDQOy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2199914","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Pranzo e nascondino","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Several days have passed since Anaak and Endorsi’s feud came to a total stop. As the next \"Tag\" test is about to begin, dark clouds begin gathering around Bam again.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3SsyBk35fB99VF0ZaTpAhFkRX85.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3SsyBk35fB99VF0ZaTpAhFkRX85.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2199915","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"La strategia di Khun","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Sia il team di Khun che quello di Wangnan e Viole continuano a salire sulla torre, affrontando le avversità che si presentano loro davanti. Nel mentre, scoprono un nuovo strumento, un chat bot sempre più popolare, Emily.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hmGXloYCfQwOk0WLnB7DDPrzwvI.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hmGXloYCfQwOk0WLnB7DDPrzwvI.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2199916","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Il mostro monocorno","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"\"My plan worked.\" With this declaration, Endorsi kicks her own teammate. What was the true intention of her plan to gather all the Fishermen in one location and see how the Ranker would act?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fmlzGoaC5bMkFaluAMqWnTPhUIh.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fmlzGoaC5bMkFaluAMqWnTPhUIh.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2199917","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Oltre la tristezza","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Rachel suffers a grave wound. How will she feel about reuniting with Bam? As their various thoughts and intentions jumble together, each one reaches their own decision in order to move forward. What waits for them beyond their sadness?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gqjmyCpTDdqK7OhxATkG02aOTBA.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gqjmyCpTDdqK7OhxATkG02aOTBA.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2199918","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Caccia subacquea (prima parte)","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Another test is held to reach the top of the tower. Much has been lost and important things have been gained in order to climb the tower. Accept it all and move forward in the direction your feelings lead you.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1bYHFRXrDjfKwnMnq6TPbBGJn2O.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1bYHFRXrDjfKwnMnq6TPbBGJn2O.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"2199919","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Caccia subacquea (seconda parte)","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"All manner of thoughts and intentions intersect at the chaotic final testing ground. While tossed about by a giant plot, the combatants boldly race across the battlefield. As the test reaches its climax, what resolve will Bam show to Rachel?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dPX1YxQhI6eaWYb5ckbAOZWltPE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dPX1YxQhI6eaWYb5ckbAOZWltPE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"2209562","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Tower of God","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Just as the guardian’s test is about to end, Bam is pushed off by Rachel. Time turns back to when the tower’s doors opened. How did Bam spend his time? What is the world Rachel saw?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2020-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":8.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tBuI6Hcq1lSWmMdxLnWknCWgX0V.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tBuI6Hcq1lSWmMdxLnWknCWgX0V.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1/episode/13"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/97860/season/1"},"fields":{},"episodes":{"1":{"checkedAt":1793374329668,"status":"ok"},"2":{"checkedAt":1793374329668,"status":"ok"},"3":{"checkedAt":1793374329668,"status":"ok"},"4":{"checkedAt":1793374329668,"status":"ok"},"5":{"checkedAt":1793374329668,"status":"ok"},"6":{"checkedAt":1793